.TH "ROARK\-USAGE\-GET" "1" "" "roark-usage-get" "Roark Analytics API Manual"
.SH "NAME"
roark\-usage\-get \- Get usage & cost
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark usage get
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Report billable usage and cost for the organization over a time window, broken down by project (highest spend first). Pass `from`/`to` as ISO 8601 timestamps; optionally pass `projectId` to scope the report to one project. Amounts are billable spend only (what we absorb is never included). Authenticated by either an organization API key with the `usage:read` permission (any project in the organization), or a project API key with the `billing:read` permission (that key's own project only; any other `projectId` is a 403).
.SH "API"
GET /v1/usage
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<value>\fR
Start of the window (inclusive), ISO 8601. Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<value>\fR
End of the window (exclusive), ISO 8601. Must be after `from`, and the window may not exceed 366 days. Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-project\-id\fR \fI<value>\fR
Limit the report to a single project. Omit for the whole organization. Optional.
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR \fI<json>\fR
Request body as JSON, or @file to read one (@\- for stdin).
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-input\fR
Never prompt; fail instead.
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fI<url>\fR
API base URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<token>\fR
Bearer token. Prefer ROARK_API_BEARER_TOKEN or the stored credential.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<ms>\fR
Request timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-retries\fR \fI<count>\fR
Retries for retryable failures.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<format>\fR
Output format: auto, json, jsonl, plain.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Shorthand for \-\-format json.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colour.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-essential output.
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-project\-base\-url\fR
Send the stored credential to a base URL set by a project .roark.json. Refused by default.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
roark usage get \-\-from <value> \-\-to <value>
.fi
.RE
